}

Warehouse "1" -- "0..*" GoodsReceipt : receives at
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" GoodsReceipt : creates or approves
GoodsReceipt "1" *-- "1..*" GoodsReceiptLine : lines
Product "1" -- "0..*" GoodsReceiptLine : product
GoodsReceiptLine "0..1" -- "0..*" Batch : creates batches
Warehouse "1" -- "0..*" Batch : stores
Product "1" -- "0..*" Batch : inventory of
Batch "0..1" --> "0..*" Batch : parent lineage
Batch "0..1" --> "0..*" Batch : root lineage
Batch "1" *-- "1" InventoryBalance : balance
Batch "1" *-- "0..*" BatchQrLabel : labels
GoodsReceipt "0..1" -- "0..*" BatchQrLabel : trace origin
Warehouse "1" -- "0..*" BatchQrLabel : current location
BatchQrLabel "1" *-- "0..*" QrLabelEvent : lifecycle
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" QrLabelEvent : performs
Batch "1" -- "0..*" InventoryTransaction : ledger
GoodsReceipt "0..1" -- "0..*" InventoryTransaction : source document
UserAccount "1" -- "0..*" InventoryTransaction : records
